    {
      "text": "Spirit of the Lord came upon him, Judg. 3:10. Spirit of the Lord began to move him, Judg. 13:25. Spirit of the Lord came upon David, 1 Sam. 16:13. Spirit of the Lord spake by me, 2 Sam. 23:2. the spirit of the Lord shall rest upon him, Isa. 11:2. Who hath directed the Spirit of the Lord, Isa. 40:13 (40:7). Spirit of the Lord shall lift up a standard, Isa. 59:19. The Spirit of the Lord God is upon me, Isa. 61:1 (Luke 4:18). Spirit of the Lord caused him to rest, Isa. 63:14. Spirit of the Lord fell upon me, Ezek. 11:5. carried me out in the spirit of the Lord, Ezek. 37:1. full of power by the spirit of the Lord, Micah 3:8.",
