    {
      "text": "Spirit of the Lord ceaseth soon to strive, 1 Ne. 7:14. I was caught away in the Spirit of the Lord, 1 Ne. 11:1. Lord God, and his Spirit, hath sent me, 1 Ne. 20:16. Lord God poured in his Spirit into my soul, Jacob 7:8. may the Spirit of the Lord be poured out upon you, Mosiah 18:13. Lord did pour out his Spirit upon them, Mosiah 25:24 (Alma 19:36; Hel. 6:36). Lord did visit them with his Spirit, Alma 17:10. they have no part nor portion of the Spirit of the Lord, Alma 40:13. Spirit of the Lord hath already ceased to strive, Morm. 5:16 (Ether 15:19).",
